Functional Source License 1.1 with Apache 2.0 future licence
------------------------------------------------------------

  tools/model-builder/        builds a model's graph from its YAML files
  tools/next-id/              suggests the next free identifier in a model
  tools/semantic-checker/     model-quality rules and the adapter that feeds them
  LICENSE-FSL                 licence text (FSL-1.1-ALv2)

You may use, modify and redistribute these tools for any Permitted Purpose,
which includes internal use, non-commercial education and research, and
professional services you provide to others. You may not use them for a
Competing Use. Each version converts to Apache-2.0 two years after its release.

Apache-2.0 covers the format and what establishes conformance with it: the
schema, the validator and the integrity tools. The FSL covers the tools that
read a model for another purpose: building its graph, suggesting its
identifiers and judging its quality. The rule engine itself is the separate
Apache-2.0 package @archally/semantic-checker; what the FSL covers here is the
Narrative rule set and its adapter.

Models you author carry their own licence terms. Archally Pro is offered under
separate terms.
